    "message": "Check an intervention's source state inside the fork that applies it\n\nApplying an approved intervention restored the source branch at the\npreview minute to compare its state hash with the preview's, and the fork\nthen restored it again. The fork's source Checkpoint holds the same state\nhash, so TimelineStore.fork now takes expected_state_hash and refuses with\nthe same message before it saves anything; ProjectAPI.fork serves both the\nfork route and the apply. A test covers the refusal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
